<--------------------------- 2. Data Transfer & Syncing ------------------------->
# Execute these commands on your LOCAL machine terminal.

<--- SCP (Secure Copy) --->
* scp -r complete-b3.ipynb assu002@hpclogin.mohesr.gov.eg:~/scratch : Upload a file/folder to a specific directory on HPC.

<--- Rsync (Smart Syncing - Uploads only changes) --->
* Upload Local to HPC (Excluding checkpoints):
  rsync -avz --progress --exclude='*.pth' \
  volleyball_project assu002@hpclogin.mohesr.gov.eg:/nfs/slurm/assu002/projects/

* Download HPC to Local (Backup changes):
  rsync -avz --progress \
  assu002@hpclogin.mohesr.gov.eg:/nfs/slurm/assu002/projects/volleyball_project/ volleyball_project


